   "type": "hero_update",
   "title": "Introducing Juno",
   "role": null,
   "description": "Introducing Juno, Overwatch 2's upcoming Support hero! Juno has landed with her versatile Mediblaster providing simultaneous healing and damage. Her Pulsar Torpedoes can lock on to multiple targets and her high mobility allows her to swiftly maneuver the battlefield to provide critical support. Plus, Juno's Hyper Ring propels the team into action, boosting movement for faster fights. Try this exciting new Support hero during a limited-time trial from July 19 through July 21 before she launches in-game in Season 12 next month!",
